  "instructions": [
    "1. Cut the fish into small pieces and marinate in a mixture of rice vinegar, soy sauce, and sliced ginger for 30 minutes.",
    "2. Heat oil in a wok or large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "3. Add the chili peppers and cook for 1 minute.",
    "4. Add the fish and cook until opaque, about 5 minutes.",
    "5. Add the wet cornstarch and stir to thicken the sauce.",
    "6. Add the water and bring to a boil.",
    "7. Reduce heat to low and simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "8. Season with salt and serve immediately."
  ],
